{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-100-1","title":"Psalms 100:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":100,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":100,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 An exhortation to praise God, cheerfully, 3 for his greatness; 4 and for his power.</p>\n<p>(Title.) A Psalm. 145:1; *title praise. or, thanksgiving. Make. 32:11; 47:1,5; 66:1,4; 95:1,2; 98:4; Isa 24:14-16; 42:10-12 Zep 3:14; Lu 19:37 all ye lands. Heb. all the earth. 67:4; 68:32; 117:1,2; De 32:43; Zec 14:9; Ro 15:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-100-2","title":"Psalms 100:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":100,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":100,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Serve. 63:4,5; 71:23; 107:21,22; De 12:12; 16:11,14; 28:47; 1Ki 8:66 Ac 2:46,47; Php 4:4 come. 42:4; 95:2; 2Ch 20:27,28; 31:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-100-3","title":"Psalms 100:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":100,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":100,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Know. 46:10; 95:3,6,7; De 4:35,39; 7:9; 1Sa 17:46,47; 1Ki 18:36-39 2Ki 19:19; Jer 10:10; Joh 17:3; Ac 17:23,24; 2Co 4:6; Ga 4:8,9 1Jo 5:20 it is he. 95:6; 119:73; 139:13-24; 149:2; Job 10:8-13; Ec 12:1; Eph 2:10 1Pe 4:19 not we ourselves. or, his we are. 12:4; 1Co 6:19,20 we are his. 74:1,2; 78:52; 79:13; 95:7; Isa 40:9-11; 63:11,19; Eze 34:11,30,31 Joh 10:14-16,26-28; Ac 20:28,29; 1Pe 2:9,25; 5:2-4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-100-4","title":"Psalms 100:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":100,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":100,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Enter. 65:1; 66:13; 116:17-19; Isa 35:10 be thankful. 96:2; 103:1,2,20-22; 145:1,2; 1Ch 29:13,20; Col 3:16,17; Heb 13:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-100-5","title":"Psalms 100:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":100,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":100,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>For the. 52:1; 86:5; 106:1; 107:1,8,15,22; 119:68; Jer 33:11 his mercy. 36:5; 103:17; 118:1-4; 136:1-26; Lu 1:50 and his truth. 85:10; 89:1,2; 119:90,91; 146:6; Ex 34:6,7; De 7:9; Jer 33:20,21 Mic 7:20; Ro 15:8,9; Tit 1:2; Heb 6:13-18 all generations. Heb. generation and generation. 89:1; *marg:</p>"}]}